# The Bishop's fourth class node: a forward channel paid for from a bank of holy
# lights instead of a cooldown.
#
# GMS makes one light every 11 seconds, banks five, and uses one for each
# second the key is held, so the skill follows the map instead of a clock. On a
# crowd the Bishop uses the light that is ready and goes back to Angel Ray;
# against a boss the lights pile up and go out together. A flat 55-second
# cooldown would give the same damage but the wrong skill: it would lock the
# player out for five seconds at a time on a map, where respawns come every
# 7.56 seconds.
#
# `pulses_per_charge` is GMS's one second of holding at its 240ms beat, 4.17
# rounded to the pulses that fit, so emptying all five lights is 20 pulses, not
# 21. The beat is `attackDelay 240`, not published elsewhere; the community DPM
# calculator's key-down tick is also 240, and its note that nine lights fire 41
# ticks agrees to within a hundredth.
#
# `base_delay_ms` is the client's own wind-up and release (`prepare/time 240`
# plus `keydownend/time 120`), the minimum a press commits to. It never matters:
# one light already takes 960ms. masonym's 1320 is the LOOP action, not this
# minimum.
#
# Dropped: the 40 MP per attack, the knockback and status immunity (nothing here
# inflicts either), and the forward hitbox, since nothing has a position. It
# doesn't retarget, which matches GMS: the light falls where the Bishop stands.
name: "Divine Punishment"
description:
  "Punish the wicked in the name of Heaven. Spends the holy light you have "
  "prepared, one for every second you hold the key, and shelters you from "
  "half of what you take while it runs."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_HOLY
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP_V skill_order: 4 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 360
cooldown_seconds: 1.5
max_enemies: 6
lines: 10
base { skill_pct: 3.38 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.13 }
channel {
  pulse_interval_ms: 240
  max_pulses: 20
  damage_taken_pct: 0.50
  charge_seconds: 11.0
  max_charges: 5
  pulses_per_charge: 4
}
